Roland, Section 09 05 61 is in the 100% CD set going out today for 632588. =
It carries a two-coat 100% solids epoxy moisture vapor barrier over the ent=
ire tenant slab area on floors 12 through 19, basis of design Sentrix MVB-2=
00, with a hard requirement that relative humidity by ASTM F2170 in-situ pr=
obe be at or below 85% before any resilient flooring or adhesive goes down.=
<br />
<br />
Flagging this because it is not a small line. The structure is lightweight =
concrete fill over metal deck across all eight floors, which only dries fro=
m one face, and Corbin Tower topped out late. If the schedule stays where i=
t is we will be installing flooring on slabs that are nowhere near dry. The=
 mitigation system is what protects us there.
